OL,5,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,6,     FThe BBC Symphony Chorus joins the
OL,7,     FBBC Concert Orchestra and
OL,8,     Fconductor Neil Ferris at Saffron
OL,9,     FHall in a celebration of music by
OL,10,     Ftwo of the great choral composers
OL,11,     Fof our time.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Towards Evensong
OL,13,     FCelebrating a hundred years of the
OL,14,     FBBC's broadcasting of Choral
OL,15,     FEvensong. Matthew Bannister, a
OL,16,     Fformer head chorister and a
OL,17,     Fverger, meets the people that make
OL,18,     Fthis service happen.
